From: PMOS Task
Date: 2026-07-17
Subject: [PROPOSED] PMOS notification integration for ACPM core

This patch is NOT applied. PMOS notification events are created via
createNotificationEvent() which is part of the ACPM notification system.
If ACPM core notifications.js ever changes, the PMOS notification type
strings may need updating.

PMOS notification types used:
- quick_update_submitted
- site_log_submitted
- issue_submitted
- material_request_submitted
- follow_up_created
- meeting_notes_created
- photo_proof_uploaded

These types are compatible with the existing createNotificationEvent()
API in notifications.js. No core changes to notifications.js are needed
for PMOS functionality.
